---
kind: lore
id: bridge.talks
title: Talking to Maelis on the chain
components: [../components/reaction.component.lute]
---

<beat after="visited('bridge.arrival')" id="maelisTerms" on="talk" target="npc.maelis" title="Show Maelis the proof" priority="30" when="quest.parley.state == 'active' && @hasProof">
  <match>
    <when test="holds('knows', ['ledger'])">
      @narrator{code="0010"}: You hold up the ledger. Maelis does not take it at first. She reads it from where she stands, the way you read a gravestone.
      @maelis{code="0010"}: Coldwater. Burned. In a clerk's hand. They wrote it down.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @narrator{code="0020"}: You hold out the tin box from the chapel. Maelis knows it before she opens it. Her hands do not.
      @maelis{code="0020"}: My mother's hand. She kept the roll. Two hundred and six. She kept counting after.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
  <match on="run.hostagesFreed">
    <when is="true">
      @maelis{code="0030"}: And you already took the miller's twins back out of my tunnel, so you are not here to bargain. You are here to be right. Gods help me, you are.
    </when>
    <when is="false">
      @maelis{code="0040"}: The children go home tonight. I will walk them to the ford myself. I don't need leverage any more. I have this.
      ::set{run.hostagesFreed = true}
    </when>
  </match>
  @isolde{code="0010" when="holds('inParty', ['isolde'])"}: Maelis. For what it's worth.
  @maelis{code="0050"}: It's worth nothing, Vane. Keep it anyway.
  ::set{run.bridge = "parleyed"}
  @maelis{code="0060"}: Drop the chain.
</beat>

<beat after="visited('bridge.arrival')" id="maelisSale" on="talk" target="npc.maelis" title="Corvin's offer" priority="20" when="quest.toll.state == 'active' && holds('inParty', ['corvin'])">
  @corvin{code="0010"}: Three deserters, a sack of your silver, and the cellar under the ford where they sleep. Ask me how I know.
  @maelis{code="0010"}: I don't care how you know. I care whether it's true.
  <branch id="sale" prompt="Maelis is listening. So is everyone else.">
    <choice id="sell" label="Tell her where they hide.">
      @maelis{code="0020"}: Then we have a bargain, Warden. Drop the chain.
      ::set{run.bridge = "sold"}
      ::use{component="reaction" who="corvin" feel="adores" instance="use-001"}
      ::use{component="reaction" who="isolde" feel="despises" instance="use-002"}
      ::set{run.approval.wren -= 4}
      @wren{code="0010" when="@wrenWithUs"}: Those are my neighbours. Tam's mother bakes on the fourth day. You just sold her son for a bridge.
    </choice>
    <choice id="balk" label="No. Not like this.">
      @corvin{code="0020"}: Suit yourself. I'll be over here, being right, quietly.
      ::set{run.tollRefused = true}
      ::use{component="reaction" who="corvin" feel="disapproves" instance="use-003"}
      ::use{component="reaction" who="isolde" feel="approves" instance="use-004"}
    </choice>
  </branch>
</beat>

<beat after="visited('bridge.arrival')" id="maelisWaiting" on="talk" target="npc.maelis" title="Maelis on the chain" once="false">
  <match on="run.bridge">
    <when is="held">
      @maelis{code="0010"}: Till the fourth night, Warden. I can count too.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @maelis{code="0020"}: The bridge is open. Use it before I remember why I closed it.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>
